    Sometimes pickup can't wait a few days — a lease expiring today, an office relocating this evening, an appliance suddenly failing and needing to go before the replacement arrives. Same-day pickup is a feasibility check, not a guaranteed service. This page covers when same-day is actually possible, what makes it more or less likely, and what to do if same-day isn't feasible for your specific situation.
